# Kaito, Bane of Nightmares, cast on turn 1 with four Moxen. A Lightning Bolt makes Bot2 lose life that turn, so his 0:
# "Surveil 2. Then draw a card for each opponent who lost life this turn" (CR 119.3) draws one: a Forest to the top and a
# Forest to the graveyard from the surveil, then the draw. On turn 5, with Bot2's Guerrilla Gorilla out, his -2 taps it
# and puts two stun counters on it (CR 122.1d); loyalty 4 + 0 - 2 is 2.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Kaito, Bane of Nightmares
Lightning Bolt
Forest x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Forest
Guerrilla Gorilla
Forest x20

